*> Соседи: строка "120304152534" — по две цифры на вершину.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BFS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GRAPH VALUE "120304152534".
   05 WS-VERTEX OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      10 WS-ADJ PIC 9 OCCURS 2 TIMES.
01 WS-DIST-TABLE.
   05 WS-DIST PIC S9(4) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
01 WS-QUEUE-TABLE.
   05 WS-QUEUE PIC 9 OCCURS 6 TIMES.
01 WS-HEAD   PIC 9(4) VALUE 1.
01 WS-TAIL   PIC 9(4) VALUE 1.
01 WS-V      PIC 9.
01 WS-U      PIC 9.
01 WS-K      PIC 9.
01 WS-OUT    PIC -(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 6
        MOVE -1 TO WS-DIST(WS-K)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DIST(1)
    MOVE 0 TO WS-QUEUE(1)
    DISPLAY "BFS order:" WITH NO ADVANCING
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-HEAD > WS-TAIL
        MOVE WS-QUEUE(WS-HEAD) TO WS-V
        ADD 1 TO WS-HEAD
        DISPLAY " " WS-V WITH NO ADVANCING
        PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 2
            MOVE WS-ADJ(WS-V + 1, WS-K) TO WS-U
            IF WS-DIST(WS-U + 1) = -1
                COMPUTE WS-DIST(WS-U + 1) = WS-DIST(WS-V + 1) + 1
                ADD 1 TO WS-TAIL
                MOVE WS-U TO WS-QUEUE(WS-TAIL)
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY SPACE
    DISPLAY "Distances:" WITH NO ADVANCING
    PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 6
        MOVE WS-DIST(WS-K) TO WS-OUT
        DISPLAY " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT) WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY SPACE
    STOP RUN.
